>> phrases := အစီအစဉ် အသစ်
	~ ['abcd']
	~ ['hello world']
	~ ['']
	~ ['@.,;"']
	~ ['this is a much much longer string to be encoded!'].

>> message := ['Phrase: ~decoded base64: ~encoded'].
	
phrases တစ်ခုစီ: { :_ :phrase 
	>> e := Server base64-ကုဒ်သွင်း: phrase.
	>> d := Server base64-ကုဒ်ဖြေ: e.
	အထွက် ရေး: (
		message ကူးယူ ~encoded: e, ~decoded: d
	), စာကြောင်းသစ်.
}.
